 02 / DESCRIPTION
`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`

 A native Windows port of Impulse Tracker 2.14, built from the
 original source code. The DOS-era workflow and original logic
 are retained, while DOS hardware services are replaced by
 native Windows audio, MIDI and UI adapters.

.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.
 03 / STATUS
`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`

 Work in progress.

 Core IT loading, editing, playback and MIDI support are
 implemented. Real-device Windows validation is still in
 progress. Not every original Impulse Tracker feature is
 complete yet.

.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.
 04 / INSTALL
`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`~v~`

 1. Unpack the archive.
 2. Run impulse-tracker.exe.
 3. Open an IT module.
 4. Enjoy the tracker.

.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.~^~.
